{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-03-21 19:25:00', 'title': 'ALPHABET INC. (NASDAQ: GOOGL, GOOG) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ALPHABET INC. (NASDAQ: GOOGL, GOOG)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN ALPHABET?\xa0 IF SO, PLEASE VISIT ALPHABET INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030\xa0OR\xa0PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM\xa0TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-03-21 10:30:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF ALPHABET INC. (GOOG, GOOGL) INVESTORS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED ALPHABET INC. (“ALPHABET” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: GOOG, GOOGL) INVESTORS SECURITIES BETWEEN FEBRUARY 4, 2020 AND JANUARY 23, 2023, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). ALPHABET INVESTORS HAVE UNTIL MAY 15, 2023 TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION.'}{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-03-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'CONCOURSE LABS EXPANDS PARTNERSHIP WITH GOOGLE CLOUD BY ANNOUNCING AVAILABILITY ON GOOGLE CLOUD MARKETPLACE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CONCOURSE LABS ANNOUNCED TODAY THE LAUNCH OF ITS CLOUD GOVERNANCE PLATFORM ON GOOGLE CLOUD MARKETPLACE, THE PLATFORM FOR ENABLING BUSINESSES TO EASILY FIND, DEPLOY, AND MANAGE PRE-CONFIGURED SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS AND TOOLS IN THE CLOUD. WITH THIS PARTNERSHIP, CUSTOMERS OF GOOGLE CLOUD NOW HAVE ACCESS TO CONCOURSE LABS' SOLUTION FOR COMPREHENSIVE CLOUD GOVERNANCE TO ASSURE THE SECURITY, RELIABILITY, AND RESILIENCY OF APPLICATION INFRASTRUCTURE."}